+    /// into a V about 25° either side of his track, as a boat's does.
+    pub const WAVE_SPEED: f32 = 2.0;
+    /// A ring fades to a third over this long, and the foam does. 0.65, was 0.55: the first
+    /// filming's streaks (what little there was) were gone in half a second; the reference's
+    /// wake fades over about a second and a half, which the water's soft fade-out of thin foam
